        "updateDeliveryMethod": "Retain the synthetic status-only update. It selects an update field without requiring configuration-version state.",
        "updateInventoryCount": "The profile selects native integer counters; expected_version, quantities and physical versions use numbers. Money component fields retain exact SDK strings.",
        "other": "Consolidated shared examples use synthetic typed IDs, positive USD amounts, six-digit verification codes and declared minimums/patterns. Exact Money SDK inputs use strings and counters use native numbers; no schema constraints are removed. All runnable examples are validated after source example protection.",
        "createPaymentIntent": "The generic schema sample uses zero, but provider payment validation requires a positive amount (at least 50 minor units for USD). The profile uses a synthetic 5000 USD minor-unit example; it does not assert live payment eligibility.",
        "createReport": "Provider report validation requires interval_end_at to be after interval_start_at. The profile uses a one-day synthetic interval rather than equal generic timestamps."
      },
