  "profileReview": {
    "paymentReads": "PaymentIntent is now the canonical base resource, with nullable last_payment_error and optional nullable risk. Merchant serialization emits risk (null when unavailable), buyer serialization omits it. The GetPaymentIntentResult component no longer exists; read responses reference PaymentIntentWithCollection, preserving its optional payment_collection extension. Remove both read-field overrides; preserve PaymentIntentWithCollection as a distinct extension with optional payment_collection.",
    "riskRequest": "createRiskListItems replaces addRiskListItems at the same POST endpoint. AddRiskListItemsRequest now requires only values; risk_controls.go decodes values and no singular value. Remove the old required-list correction. Neither/singular fail locally for missing values; both fields dispatch, then the server rejects unknown value via decodeJSONBody/DisallowUnknownFields (customers.go). Do not invent an additionalProperties correction.",
